                                "sense_id": "14f28a1f-2565-380e-a30d-1e4b99e33d01",
                                "text": "I know he knowes that watrie lakish hill"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2c96cb4d-fe7d-45dc-8e30-74ef160072ee",
                                "sense_id": "14f28a1f-2565-380e-a30d-1e4b99e33d01",
                                "text": "These men first gouerned the Citty in her Nonage, and some are of the minde, that they were the first Authors of the Padnaus slight, and their retyrement to the Lakish or marshie Isles, as also of their first building there."
                            }
                        ]
